<h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Crunching_the_numbers"></span>Phân tích số liệu<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><div class="yea-video-wrap" style="position:relative;padding-bottom:56.25%;height:0;overflow:hidden;margin:16px 0;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08);">
